// News publication, reading, subscriptions, and notices through mock sessions.
// Subscription options are set by eval to isolate the news display scenarios.

// Reset the seeded edition, deliver an article, and publish it.
@wizard
; $news:set_current_news({}); return 1;
1
; return $mail_agent:send_message(player, {$news}, "News subject", {"News body line."});
{1, #61}
% @addnews $ to #61
~~new edition
=Current newspaper set.
~~News subject
~~----+

// A player reads the current edition.
@nonprogrammer
; return 1;
~~new edition

% news
~~It's the current issue
=
~~, 20
~~NEWS SUBJECT
~~News body line.
=
~~(end)

% news new
=The news has no new messages.

// Denied: a non-writer cannot publish.
% @addnews $ to #61
=You can't write the news.

// The contents option lists headers only.
@wizard
; return #101.mail_options = ["news" -> "contents"];
["news" -> "contents"]

@nonprogrammer
% news
~~News subject
~~----+

// The unread-news notice follows the player's option.
@programmer
; return 1;
~~new edition
; $news:check(); return 1;
1
~~There is new news
